","quote":"太史公曰：張蒼文學律歷，為漢名相，而絀賈生、公孫臣等言正朔服色事而不遵，明用秦之顓頊歷，何哉？周昌，木彊人也。任敖以舊德用。申屠嘉可謂剛毅守節矣，然無術學，殆與蕭、曹、陳平異矣。"}],"rationale":"按本篇分傳、明示姓名與敘事承接限定短稱；韋賢與韋玄成分傳區別，第23段掾陳平另候選，第25段長安相工田文不與孟嘗君合併。趙堯、任敖、申屠嘉、鄧通、晁錯的短名依各段人物語境，王陵夫人與王陵分人。張蒼父長不滿五尺的長為身長敘述，不作父名。王侯與太子未詳名不補名，跨篇同指另待證據。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p020","text":"太史公曰：張蒼文學律歷，為漢名相，而絀賈生、公孫臣等言正朔服色事而不遵，明用秦之顓頊歷，何哉？周昌，木彊人也。任敖以舊德用。申屠嘉可謂剛毅守節矣，然無術學，殆與蕭、曹、陳平異矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"2ed_ew8_szv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"張蒼","kind":"person","person_id":"796_nkw_0jz_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"賈生","kind":"person","person_id":"n1e_bz7_1di","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"公孫臣","kind":"person","person_id":"7kl_if8_wye","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"周昌","kind":"person","person_id":"u7w_vak_29r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"任敖","kind":"person","person_id":"yka_hay_sdj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"申屠嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"yph_dkb_w4w","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"蕭","kind":"person","person_id":"9dx_y3b_try","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"曹","kind":"person","person_id":"ifc_1dx_zrh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m020-0084","start":84,"end":86,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"yzr_p69_1y0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],